      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "void_beacon_activated" },
        { "type": "giveItem", "itemType": "void_frequency_log" },
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 35 },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "Half-buried in the hardpan — a signal beacon, old enough to predate the Collapse. Its shell is cracked but the core still pulses with a faint, rhythmic light.",
          "You brush the dust away and find an output port. The beacon has been recording — broadcasting into the void and logging whatever came back.",
          "A frequency log. Centuries of signals bouncing off... something. The return patterns are too regular to be natural.",
          "The Archivist in Meridian — or Councillor Asha — would want to see this. Something is out there, past the edge of every map."
        ]}
      ],
